    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>8级 杂兵 护卫</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 元素界 类人生物（地系）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 24，''强韧'' 22，''反射'' 20，''意志'' 19</span><span>''侦查'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 石化</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，飞行 8</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">残忍爪</div>\n<div class=description>每当一个敌人离开一个邻接该黑曜石石像鬼的格子时，该敌人受到 4 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">潜伏存在</div>\n<div class=description>该黑曜石石像鬼对抗敌人被动侦查的隐秘检定获得+10 加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}爪击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+13vs.AC<br>命中：8 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+14，隐秘+11</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 20（+9）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 16（+7）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+6）</span><span>''智力'' 5（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 11（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 荒神语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
